# E1b harness core hardening — implementation checkpoint

Task: .bboxy/tasks/2026-10-31-harness-core-hardening.md (#1117).
Branch: e1b-hardening; base: 71a4d95. No merge or release.

This is an implementation checkpoint, not the final verification report. The
final unattended gate, pinned Java parity, live smoke and benchmark outcome
have not yet been recorded for this source revision.

Implemented: bounded cancellation drain and reaped group ownership; tagged
A–B–A cancellation and exactly-once steer/control models; specific protocol
law assertions; real pgid, stale completion, policy and control-lane witnesses;
live bounded exec deltas with repair snapshots; durable tool identity recovery;
whole tracked-tree secret scanning and manifest headers; trusted epoch cursors
and durable epoch high-water marks; permit-backed off-worker hooks and a
structural four-permit runtime gate.

